-page h3 {\n226:         font-size: 1.25rem;\n227:     }\n228: \n229:     .content-page table {\n230:         font-size: 0.875rem;\n231:     }\n232: \n233:     .content-page table th,\n234:     .content-page table td {\n235:         padding: 0.5rem;\n236:     }\n237: }\n238: </style>\n239: \n240:     <!-- Analytics -->\n241:     <script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-QE7MR4DVTV\"></script>\n242:     <script defer>\n243:         window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n244:         function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n245:         gtag('js', new Date());\n246:         gtag('config', 'G-QE7MR4DVTV');\n247:     </script>\n248: </head>\n249: <body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\">\n250: \n251: <div class=\"content-page\">\n252:         <h1>How Free AI Video Upscaler Works</h1>\n253: \n254:     <div class=\"mb-4\">\n255:         <div style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;\">\n256:             <iframe\n257:                 src=\"https://livid.com/embed/Jn8K7XtLiHyS\"\n258:                 style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\"\n259:                 allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n260:                 allowfullscreen\n261:                 frameborder=\"0\"\n262:                 referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n263:                 title=\"Free AI Video Upscaler Demo\"\n264:             ></iframe>\n265:         </div>\n266:         <small><a href=\"https://livid.com/watch/Jn8K7XtLiHyS\">https://livid.com/watch/Jn8K7XtLiHyS</a></small>\n267:     </div>\n268: \n269:     <h2>Why the tool is free</h2>\n270:     <p>100% client-side processing using WebGPU — your device does all the work, videos never touch our servers. Because we have zero server costs, we can offer unlimited free service with no signup, no watermarks, and no time limits. Complete privacy: no one sees your videos, not even us.</p>\n271:     <p>Other \"free\" tools either require signup (Canva), add watermarks (Hitpaw), have time limits, or require software installation (Topaz, Waifu2x). Processing happens on your device with zero setup. Also open source — code available on GitHub.</p>\n272: \n273:     <h2>Overview</h2>\n274:     <p>Free AI Video Upscaler is an open-source, browser-based video upscaling tool that uses WebGPU technology to process videos entirely in your web browser. This means:</p>\n275:     <ul>\n276:         <li><strong>Zero cost to you:</strong> No server processing fees</li>\n277:         <li><strong>Unlimited use:</strong> Process as many videos as you want</li>\n278:         <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> Your videos never leave your device</li>\n279:         <li><strong>No signup:</strong> Start upscaling immediately</li>\n280:         <li><strong>Open source:</strong> Code is available on <a href=\"https://github.com/sb2702/free-ai-video-upscaler\">GitHub</a></li>\n281:     </ul>\n282: \n283:     <h2>The Technology</h2>\n284: \n285:     <h3>WebGPU & WebGL Processing</h3>\n286:     <p>We use WebGPU (or WebGL as fallback), web standards that allow GPU-accelerated computing directly in your browser. This enables:</p>\n287:     <ul>\n288:         <li>AI-powered video enhancement</li>\n289:         <li>Client-side processing (your computer does the work)</li>\n290:         <li>No file uploads to external servers</li>\n291:         <li><strong>WebGPU:</strong> Faster processing (2-5x) on Chrome, Edge, and newer Safari versions</li>\n292:         <li><strong>WebGL:</strong> Automatic fallback for Firefox and older Safari, same quality but slower processing</li>\n293:     </ul>\n294: \n295:     <h3>How It's Different from Other Free Tools</h3>\n296:     <ul>\n297:         <li><strong>Canva:</strong> Free but requires signup, 1 minute limit, 1080p max</li>\n298:         <li><strong>Hitpaw:</strong> Free version has 10 min limit, adds watermark, requires download/install/GPU setup</li>\n299:         <li><strong>Waifu2x/Video2X:</strong> Free but requires technical setup, command line, GPU drivers</li>\n300:         <li><strong>Topaz/TensorPix:</strong> High quality but paid ($299 or $30/hour)</li>\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
